              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yeova ambĩa, Enda ĩngĩ, ũmwende mũndũ mũka, kĩlaalai, wendetwe nĩ mũnyanyae, o tondũ Yeova wendete ana ma Isilaeli, o na kau methyũũĩaa ngai ingĩ, na kwenda tũkũmbwa twa nzavivũ mbovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
